# AWS credentials for src/claude.ts, which calls Claude Sonnet 5 via AWS Bedrock.
#
# The default AWS SDK credential provider chain is the primary path — if you already
# have credentials configured in ~/.aws/credentials (or via AWS_PROFILE), you don't
# need this file at all. Uncomment below only to override that with explicit
# access-key credentials.
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
# AWS_SESSION_TOKEN=...

# API key for src/environmentalPollution/, which calls the 環境部環境資料開放平臺
# (data.moenv.gov.tw) open-data API — required by MOENV for every request, unlike this
# repo's other public-data CLIs. Register (free) at https://data.moenv.gov.tw/api-term
# to get one; each pipeline's main.ts loads this file via process.loadEnvFile(), so a
# real value in your own .env (not this .example file) is picked up automatically.
# MOENV_API_KEY=...
